  "paragraphs": [
   "More than half of us who menstruate get pain every single month.* And stress turns the volume up: in one population study, painful periods ran 44% among women under high stress versus 22% under low.* Cramp Deleting is the soak we formulated for those crampy days. 245g of concentrated stresscare nutrients, natural magnesium chloride, omega-6 GLA, OEA aminos and vitamins B1 and B6.",
   "We reach for this one when the calendar app already knows. When the heating pad has been on since noon. When we've cancelled the thing we actually wanted to go to. Heat for period pain has 25 trials behind it.* Fifteen minutes, up to three times during that week.",
   "* American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists, \"Dysmenorrhea: Painful Periods,\" patient FAQ. Wang et al., \"Stress and dysmenorrhoea: a population based prospective study,\" Occupational and Environmental Medicine, 2004;61:1021–1026. Heat therapy for primary dysmenorrhea: a systematic review and meta-analysis, Frontiers in Medicine, 2026 (25 randomized trials, n=2,393).",
   "** 3,000+ customers surveyed on Flewd's website over 3 years. Individual results may vary.",
   "Fifteen minutes on Sunday, and it is still working on Wednesday. 79% of surveyed customers told us they still felt calmer 3+ days later, and others told us they felt it for 5 days or more.",
   "Racing thoughts, that feeling of being \"always on\". One 15-minute soak and the edge just softens.",
   "Stress never shows up predictably. Wired but tired on Monday, overwhelmed by Thursday, and spiraling on Sunday. We need something formulated for every stress swirl.",
   "How can we believe that one powder, one blanket, or one app could cover it all? We’d never trust one shampoo for every hair type.",
   "So, we didn’t make one soak and call it stresscare. A different soak for whatever day we just survived.",
   "43 life events, Holmes & Rahe, 1967. 16 stress symptoms, APA Stress in America, 2023.",
   "No daily thing to forget, no calendar alerts, no phone alarms, no feelings of failing. Just one pouch, fifteen minutes, on any night our brain will not turn off.",
   "It's not another task on our to-do list, it's not more pressure on our day. Nothing to remember, nothing to fall behind on.",
   "We choose when we need it, on our own time.",
   "Each pouch is 245g of concentrated stresscare ingredients. Magnesium chloride at 47% concentration, plus the vitamins, aminos and nootropics chosen for this soak. No fillers, no trace amounts. Always non-toxic, zero parabens, totally vegan, cruelty-free. The full ingredient list is on this page."
  ]
 },
